# Multi-board firmware

Platform is **pinned pioarduino** in [`platformio.ini`](platformio.ini) (`[esp32]`). Official `platform = espressif32` is not for new chips (no C5 / C6 / P4).

New boards follow README **Adding a board**. Do not copy the historical PDF starter (`qspi_opi`, 8MB partitions, SDMMC, huge rings).

## Current envs

- `[env:matrix]` — Waveshare ESP32-S3-Matrix (default)
- `[env:c5]` — ESP32-C5-DevKitC-1-N8R4 (UART `Serial`, no CDC-on-boot)

